{"schemaVersion":1,"slug":"krupave-teriyaki-tofu-s-brokolici","title":"Křupavé teriyaki tofu s brokolicí","description":"Pečené tofu obalené škrobem s brokolicí a hustou teriyaki glazurou.","demo":false,"yield":{"amount":4,"label":"porce"},"prepMinutes":15,"cookMinutes":35,"category":"Hlavní jídla","tags":["Veganské","Tofu","Asijská kuchyně"],"ingredients":[{"items":[{"id":"tofu","name":"extra pevné tofu","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":400},"unit":"g","note":"scezené, na kostky","approximate":true},{"id":"repkovy-olej","name":"řepkový olej","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":30},"unit":"ml"},{"id":"skrob","name":"kukuřičný škrob","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":4.5},"unit":"tbsp"},{"id":"brokolice","name":"růžičky brokolice","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":450},"unit":"g","approximate":true},{"id":"sul","name":"jemná sůl","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":0.5},"unit":"tsp"},{"id":"pepr","name":"mletý černý pepř","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":0.5},"unit":"tsp"},{"id":"teriyaki","name":"hustá teriyaki omáčka","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":80},"unit":"ml","approximate":true},{"id":"cibulka","name":"jarní cibulka","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":30},"unit":"g","note":"na tenká kolečka","approximate":true}]}],"steps":["Troubu předehřejte na 220 °C. Tofu nechte 10–15 minut oschnout na utěrce.","Promíchejte tofu s polovinou oleje a obalte ve škrobu. Dejte na jednu polovinu plechu. Brokolici promíchejte se zbylým olejem, solí a pepřem a rozložte vedle.","Pečte asi 30 minut; v polovině tofu i brokolici obraťte.","Teriyaki omáčku v pánvi 2–3 minuty prohřívejte do zhoustnutí. Vmíchejte tofu, posypte cibulkou a podávejte s brokolicí."],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.thespruceeats.com/crispy-teriyaki-tofu-with-broccoli-recipe-8431066","author":"Jasmine Smith · The Spruce Eats","importedAt":"2026-09-19"}],"provenance":{"kind":"facts"}}
